  "sourceTitle": "Xocai Ice Cream",
  "sourceText": "Xocai Ice Cream\nBy: Adam Paul Green\nPublished: Monday, June 4, 2012 - 4:10pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/2 cup sugar (or other sweetener)\n2  egg yolks\n1/2 cup liquid Xocai Activ\n1 pinch salt\n1 3/4 cups low-fat whipping cream (divided)\n1 cup fresh berries\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Blend well sugar, egg yolks, Xocai Activ, salt and 3 tbsp of the cream. Blend in rest of the cream. Chill. Churn in an ice cream maker. Top fresh fruit. Serves 4\n\nAbout\n\nXocai Healthy Dark Chocolate Ice Cream",
